                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Although opinions on this game have always been divisive, to me this will always remain as one of the best indie games of all time. Phenomenal score, eye-candy pixel art, and an atmosphere that I can never forget. Although the content suffers from a rush to meet a deadline, there's still enough story and gameplay to justify the time spent on it. Every frame is straight out of a painting, It's not a perfect game, but in the world we live in, nothing truly is. \n\nOwlboy is a hidden diamond in a sea of rough sand, I'd highly recommend.",
